                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                        "entry_id": "85275ddb-b147-3be0-94c3-1a75b103a31f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Experiencing or harboring no doubts; entirely confident."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c6aee80-f090-4ed1-bad4-78f1611db069",
                                "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                                "text": "And we shall have an undoubting assurance that that this Kingdom is in such a measure within us, as will ripen to perfection in due time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a62aef4-6365-4a58-81f0-fca7ee01f508",
                                "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                                "text": "And God's declared design in all this is, that the heirs of the promises might have an undoubting hope."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7aba736-10bf-4b39-9884-9a4168fcd5ea",
                                "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                                "text": "With undoubting decision she directly began her adieus; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ac7bb82-bd0b-4bd4-ae4b-21cd3d849186",
                                "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                                "text": "It was the part of a gentleman to preserve a bearing that was, as far as he could make it, the bearing of an undoubting lover."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbf21bb1-3963-43de-91ac-55e006fa9508",
                                "sense_id": "a4c794fd-3f54-31dc-a502-b045acd62330",
                                "text": "This overstuffed, smug, showy and sentimental music can almost persuade when it is performed with undoubting conviction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
